cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Manacá-1B-Instruct, please cite the preprint below."
title: "Manacá-1B-Instruct: An Open, Auditable Instruction-Tuned Brazilian-Portuguese Language Model, with a Negative Result on DPO and a Safety-SFT Alignment"
abstract: >-
  Manacá-1B-Instruct is the instruction-tuned version of the Manacá-1B base model
  (~1.72B parameters, Brazilian Portuguese). This repository releases, in an
  auditable and reproducible way, the whole post-training path to the safe
  instruct: the SFT corpus and code (v1 and v2), the training logs, the
  comparative evaluation against other PT-BR instruct models, and the safety
  alignment. It documents a negative result (on-policy DPO did not change free
  generation) and the adopted method (an AnswerCarefully-style safety-SFT), so
  that every reported number can be recomputed.
type: software
